name Malcolm MacNeill
gender male
birth -date 'about 1700'
note {
	Malcolm of Tarbert
}
note {
	Mary of Colonsay
}

body {
$blockquote{$pre{
Donald of Tarbert, above mentioned, had issue:

1. Malcolm of Tarbert, who married, 1st, Mary,
   daughter of Donald, first of Colonsay, 2nd, Janet Simp-
   son.
2. Florence, who married Reverend Neil Campbell.
3. Neil.
4. John.


Malcolm of Tarbert, by his first marriage had:

a. Lachlan of Tarbert.
b. Malcolm of Drumchoir, who married his first
   cousin Florence McNeill of Ardnacross and had a son
   Neil McNeill of Ardnacross, who married Annabelle
   Gillies.
c. Neil of Ardtally.
d. Margaret, who married Lachlan McNeil of
   Machrihanish.
e. Daughter, who married James McNeill.
}}

}
family {
  spouse {
     key macneill-mary-1700-macneill
   }
   child {
		name Neil NacNeill
